/-!
# A260684

Irregular triangular array read by rows.  Row n gives the primes in the prime factorization of n! that have exponent of 1.

The 60 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `2`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

